#: ../../tutorials/index.md:7
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "チュートリアル"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:9
msgid ""
"These pages show implementations for specific optimization scenarios. "
"Choose a page for single-objective, multi-objective, constrained, mixed-"
"variable, or another goal. Each page is an example for one scenario and "
"does not assume a particular configuration depth."
msgstr ""
"具体的な最適化シナリオに対する実装例を示します。 単目的、多目的、制約、混合変数など、目的に合うページを選べます。 "
"シナリオごとの実装例であり、構成の深さを前提にしません。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:13
msgid "Optimization scenarios"
msgstr "最適化シナリオ"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:19
msgid "Single-Objective Optimization"
msgstr "{fa}`bullseye;sd-mr-1` 単目的最適化"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:23
msgid ""
"Solve an expensive single-objective problem with `minimize()`, choosing "
"the algorithm, surrogate, and evaluation strategy."
msgstr "アルゴリズム、サロゲートモデル、評価戦略を選び、評価コストの高い単目的問題を`minimize()`で解きます。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:26
msgid "Multi-Objective Optimization"
msgstr "{fa}`layer-group;sd-mr-1` 多目的最適化"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:30
msgid ""
"Solve a problem with trade-offs between objectives and extract the Pareto"
" front."
msgstr "目的間にトレードオフのある問題を解き、パレートフロントを抽出します。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:33
msgid "Constrained Optimization"
msgstr "{fa}`shield-halved;sd-mr-1` 制約付き最適化"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:37
msgid ""
"Define inequality constraints and control how infeasible solutions are "
"handled."
msgstr "不等式制約を定義し、実行不可能解の扱い方を制御します。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:40
msgid "Mixed-Variable Optimization"
msgstr "{fa}`shapes;sd-mr-1` 混合変数最適化"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:44
msgid ""
"Solve problems that include integer and categorical variables alongside "
"continuous variables."
msgstr "連続変数に加えて整数変数、カテゴリ変数を含む問題を解きます。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:47
msgid "Dynamic Switching"
msgstr "{fa}`arrows-rotate;sd-mr-1` 動的な切り替え"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:51
msgid ""
"Switch the evaluation strategy or `SurrogateManager` at runtime based on "
"the surrogate's prediction accuracy."
msgstr "サロゲートの予測精度に応じて、評価戦略や`SurrogateManager`を実行中に切り替えます。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:54
msgid "Reproducibility and Checkpointing"
msgstr "{fa}`floppy-disk;sd-mr-1` 再現性とチェックポイント"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:58
msgid "Make long-running optimizations reproducible and resumable."
msgstr "長時間実行する最適化を再現可能かつ再開可能にします。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:61
msgid "Logging Progress"
msgstr "{fa}`file-lines;sd-mr-1` 進捗のログ記録"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:65
msgid "Record optimization progress with the standard `logging` module."
msgstr "標準の`logging`モジュールで、最適化の進捗を記録します。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:68
msgid "Integrating External Libraries"
msgstr "{fa}`plug;sd-mr-1` 外部ライブラリとの連携"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:72
msgid ""
"Incorporate scikit-learn and PyTorch models as surrogates, and pymoo "
"operators, algorithms, and problems, through adapters."
msgstr "アダプターを通じて、scikit-learnとPyTorchのモデルをサロゲートとして、pymooの演算子、アルゴリズム、問題を組み込みます。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:89
msgid "Configuration and control"
msgstr "構成と操作"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:91
msgid ""
"These guides cover choosing built-in components, assembling the low-level"
" API, and adding Hooks or Callbacks to an execution path. The guides "
"contain the details; this page provides an overview and links."
msgstr ""
"ビルトインコンポーネントの選択、低レベルAPIの構成、実行経路へのHookやCallbackの追加を扱います。 "
"詳細な内容は各ガイドで扱い、ここでは概要とリンクを示します。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:98
msgid "Choose and swap built-in components"
msgstr "{fa}`puzzle-piece;sd-mr-1` ビルトインコンポーネントを選んで差し替える"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:101
msgid "Choose the built-in component for a responsibility."
msgstr "責務に対応するビルトインコンポーネントを選びます。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:104
msgid "Assemble Optimizer with the low-level API"
msgstr "{fa}`sliders;sd-mr-1` Optimizerを低レベルAPIで組み立てる"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:107
msgid ""
"Assemble a full configuration with a surrogate, combine termination "
"conditions, and inspect each generation with `iterate()`."
msgstr "サロゲート込みの完全な構成、終了条件の組み合わせ、`iterate()` による世代ごとの取得を扱います。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:110
msgid "Choose a Hook, Stage, or Callback"
msgstr "{fa}`eye;sd-mr-1` Hook、Stage、Callbackを選ぶ"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:113
msgid "Choose how to extend and observe an execution path."
msgstr "実行経路への追加と観測を選びます。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:116
msgid "Run an optimization with the high-level API"
msgstr "{fa}`rocket;sd-mr-1` 高レベルAPIで最適化を実行する"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:119
msgid "Run an optimization through the high-level API and read its Result."
msgstr "高レベルAPIを使った最適化の実行とResultの読み方を確認します。"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:122
msgid "Implement a custom component"
msgstr "{fa}`puzzle-piece;sd-mr-1` 独自Componentを実装する"

#: ../../tutorials/index.md:125
msgid ""
"Implement, register, and test a custom component that follows an existing"
" contract. The guide also covers porting external Operators to native "
"code."
msgstr "既存の契約に沿った独自Componentを実装し、登録してテストします。外部Operatorのnative移植も扱います。"
